{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "f598b3f2f94528394b90866848d125dc6ccda432be0178c67db8e6cbdf7da666", "ja": "二度と裏切っちゃダメ……だよ？", "zh": "绝不能再背叛我了……好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "414bc19e199d601fb0da65f1f1e5aa7e3c6083396ea72eac1829a4c9761ef102", "ja": "昴が帰宅すると、兄達が昴の好物を用意して\nおり、先日の謝罪をされる。昴はもう怒って\nいない事や素直な気持ちを告げる。一方の\n亜美も、プロデューサーと話した事で、\nやる気が最高潮に達する。", "zh": "昴回到家后，哥哥们为她准备了她最爱吃的食物，并为前几天的事向她道歉。昴告诉他们自己已经不生气了，也说出了心里的真实感受。另一边，亚美与制作人谈过之后，干劲也达到了顶峰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1000_047sub", "source_sha256": "76e9b6d2b76df3060fff130b4aa73f04ac8aa24e35173ffacf207322ee66ec65", "ja": "兄ちゃんたち、どうかしたの？\n……あれ、夕飯ができてる。珍しー……。", "zh": "哥哥们，你们怎么了？\n……咦，晚饭已经做好了。真少见……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "21c13a71f8fa37ddb7d374922cb4af99a3fa6f2f5ee4656029cc31f26f524bb1", "ja": "って、どうしたの今日！　すっげー豪華じゃん！？\nうわぁ、とんかつがひとり2枚もあるよ～！", "zh": "等等，今天是怎么回事！也太丰盛了吧！？  \n哇，每个人居然有2块炸猪排～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1002_hiroto", "source_sha256": "494cef2c1e1aa89fcc6844142861b282a0335c5a5bbb3d569a9aef05ec0752d7", "ja": "昴……ごめん！！", "zh": "昴……对不起！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "d459263f5c27e1ea2157b40532f188debf2d061dc8ce48ce0765bb372d5cd710", "ja": "へ？", "zh": "耶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1004_souta", "source_sha256": "b61d3ff5c68c7aec17d1fe68d0d3829ca89a2817c76fbc910bc7e1917867052b", "ja": "昨日の事だよ。ヒロ兄が昴のこと、\n京都のアイドルと比べてどうとか言ってただろ。", "zh": "是昨天的事。阿浩哥说要把昴和京都的偶像比较一下什么的，你不记得了吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "d72d6c5e079b05548dabfe15ea2f66ffbb3e0b4b1277fb3cc702397877c0bfaa", "ja": "……。\n別に、もう怒ってねーし。", "zh": "……\n我又没在生气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1006_hiroto", "source_sha256": "89714271181939d8e1357cc327eaf3930a483606bdbc3c3e371645f0a72a3fe4", "ja": "いや、怒ってるじゃん！？\nだからその、ちゃんと謝りたくて……。", "zh": "不是，你这不就是生气了吗！？\n所以那个，我想好好向你道歉……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1007_taiki", "source_sha256": "836a2dae8b79ac282a7ed2aeb566a1f8a559a7fc467068726b4da1cbfb7b2472", "ja": "俺もだ。昴が何よりもアイドルを頑張ってるって\n知ってるのに、茶化すような事を言って悪かったな。", "zh": "我也是。明明知道昴比什么都努力地当偶像，却还说了些像是在取笑她的话，对不起啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1009_masato", "source_sha256": "ec9b9ad709db09048201279caeb2bfd4f314bb90bb5b1a418eddc32f9fd595d3", "ja": "俺も、あまり真剣に受け止めてなかった。\n昴、悪かったな。", "zh": "我也没有太当回事。\n昴，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "c3fdc6486622827816f54d282dbea6b46b21ba5ff6462d7d47807214beac8fc6", "ja": "……それで、とんかつ？", "zh": "……所以，就吃炸猪排？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1011_souta", "source_sha256": "f513cb54a552e9e4ebdc217dfd3b1edf8e0ea92d24dc78e04277bae18ab412a0", "ja": "そっ。昴、好きだろ？　それに、\n大事な勝負の前はやっぱとんかつだろ！ってな！", "zh": "对。昴，你喜欢吧？而且，在重要比赛前果然还是得吃炸猪排嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "96f7d3dbe472b91a9ce3f0af556433a29051708fc9855bd8da5c9a73e94e6cb8", "ja": "ぷっ……あは、あはははは！\nも～、ほんとバカだな～！", "zh": "噗……啊哈、啊哈哈哈哈！\n真是的～你也太傻了吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "696054d389d5919d007b58e3716d48775877d1f0fc83f710f1395b035d03d5da", "ja": "別に……こんなふうに機嫌取ってくれなくたって、\nオレ、兄ちゃんたちをキライになんかなんねーし！", "zh": "才不用……你们没必要像这样哄我，我也不会讨厌哥哥们的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1014_hiroto", "source_sha256": "3a9e7b8c989747cc766c7d6ccb6dc33207fae1fb805387f5f74ea3bad849ac78", "ja": "昴……！", "zh": "昴……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "c7388bb63119ebc283ac787d3c5db2927f23c612d4bc22e5f18fe406bd9c1c63", "ja": "ただ、あの時はなんていうか……。", "zh": "只是，那时候该怎么说呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "04a11d0fffef81f294fc9f39ffa0cfa783032e69aa74210ac58f8ca8f2716cac", "ja": "兄ちゃんたちが、オレより他の子を褒めるから！\nそれで、ムカついたっていうか……別に、それだけ！", "zh": "因为哥哥你们总是夸别的孩子，不夸我！\n所以我才有点不爽……也没别的，就只是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1017_taiki", "source_sha256": "f267d39bb10751cf81563a7c81cc7dd105338c970414781d752cb0e0638f9695", "ja": "……！？\n祐翔……聞いたか、今の……！", "zh": "……！？\n祐翔……你听到了吗，刚才的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1018_hiroto", "source_sha256": "7a84295df33d982ce45ed59b465b24272b51d48f3ac917fce735fcb4af68cb62", "ja": "聞いたぜ、大輝！　それってつまり、\n昴がヤキモチを妬いてた……って、コトだよな！？", "zh": "我听大辉说了！也就是说，昴她……\n吃醋了……对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1019_taiki", "source_sha256": "e022b591a6590e053dfcd4bace5d3682d9b4d49e4d902df8287d391898c159de", "ja": "うわ～、今の録音しとけば良かった～！！！\nもったいないことした……！", "zh": "哇～，刚才要是录下来就好了～！！！\n太可惜了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "80884d34fd7d1371c76c74cf4e706bc80fd91ec988238c45c5796c84ca52888e", "ja": "あーもー！　すぐこれだよ！　兄ちゃんたちって、\nオレのことになると、すぐはしゃぐよな！？", "zh": "啊—真是的！动不动就这样！哥哥你们啊，\n只要一扯到我的事，就会立刻起哄吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "03a09e29fa9a85c6ae37ef0ccee5629d4e32ae34c1fd488fd6ef9778e42d86e8", "ja": "もう、そういうのいいから！\nほら、とんかつ冷めないうちに食おうぜ！", "zh": "哎呀，别闹了啦！\n好啦，趁炸猪排还没凉快吃吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1022_null", "source_sha256": "ade02e4c64c2d4b391c9f976cad378973fa112398de64d77e61cd18f8c7edca7", "ja": "その頃……", "zh": "与此同时……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1023_p", "source_sha256": "4a3f6f603a08d6d943f6aebb79f93579ecf393780a663e56ae81e01ed418204c", "ja": "（みんなの特訓は、無事終わったみたいだ。\n表情も明るかったし、発散できたなら良かった）", "zh": "（大家的特训好像顺利结束了。\n看她们表情也很开朗，能发泄一番就好。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1024_p", "source_sha256": "318d8bc0e74d6aad8659974513ff87866dc150d46020ed9027bfd9872b197c76", "ja": "（次の京都での仕事も近いし、タイミング的には\n今だな。改めて、みんなには謝っておかないと……）", "zh": "（下次在京都的工作也快到了，从时机上来说就是现在。得再向大家道个歉才行……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1025_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1026_011ami", "source_sha256": "4b7af52b1af9b35e7b9d2e0002c8fdabbfb2c20070bd559b6c8d7661f6e1bee4", "ja": "あっ。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1027_p", "source_sha256": "c0fa34975f7b68bd60f537693154faa90be14a1970fa51c867ed32ff6f6624b9", "ja": "あっ、亜美！\nまだ残ってたのか、ちょうど良かった。", "zh": "啊，亚美！\n你还没走啊，正好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1028_011ami", "source_sha256": "e1da384456fd85451667dfc7f533f187db70a12578263b854425c94d2109aae7", "ja": "亜美じゃないもん。真美だもん。", "zh": "才不是亚美。人家是真美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1029_p", "source_sha256": "1183616035c92648cec7346144e44569e5c01d687b7cf92f2cab3abdba4c0117", "ja": "いや、髪の長さが違うだろ……。\nこの前の、京都での仕事の事だけど。", "zh": "不，头发长度都不一样吧……\n我是想谈谈之前在京都工作的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1030_p", "source_sha256": "d414a5c85f8988d2a6e7736a8db174debf465a7ce0ef4e80dff48e5ec03765fd", "ja": "亜美達はステージ前だったのに、\n心配かけて悪かったな。", "zh": "明明亚美她们马上就要上台了，却还让她们担心，真是对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1031_011ami", "source_sha256": "506e6386ce641188bbd2e8084a2c95ded1af4de854e3bd7c08b8bdd89691f964", "ja": "亜美は別に、心配なんかしてないしー。", "zh": "亚美才没有担心什么呢——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1032_p", "source_sha256": "30e13d57b2bed2cf8268a6e4cad15f058d0e5faad1af5b6860a78507d0e14230", "ja": "そうか。じゃあ……\n不甲斐ないところを見せて、すまなかった。", "zh": "这样啊。那我就……\n抱歉，让你看到我这么没出息的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1033_011ami", "source_sha256": "a3cda6ed76f977d174c3216ed1ac31e283d703bdf3460db0fe3aea781c6bca1c", "ja": "まあねー。まさか兄ちゃんが、亜美たち以外に\nあーんなにデレデレするとは……。", "zh": "就是说嘛～。真没想到哥你除了对亚美我们之外，\n竟然还会那么神魂颠倒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1034_011ami", "source_sha256": "bfe11d2634de90d55a68d271b5f7b7e238c4408113395089f7a76b45df1cfa7b", "ja": "SHADE OF SPADEのセクシー代表として、\nメタメタに傷ついたかんね、亜美は！", "zh": "作为SHADE OF SPADE的性感代表，\n亚美的心灵可是受了重创呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1035_p", "source_sha256": "ec443f11e80d29a55ee4465dcab1ffa157f14e55176374e1c922dccb250a31b6", "ja": "いつの間に代表に……。\nいや、でもそうだよな。", "zh": "什么时候成代表了……\n不对，不过确实是这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1036_011ami", "source_sha256": "095f2c27ae04d2e5ae808c30b08ecc5a92059a4d0aff880f8973f6ed81c3358d", "ja": "あとは……亜美、チームのみんなのコト、\nちょびっと不安にさせちゃったし。", "zh": "还有……亜美也让队里的大家，稍微有点不安了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1037_011ami", "source_sha256": "edc3e85f33ca175cdc7137c846a0be7d3570e6ca5f45ccaddec31c586e8a211f", "ja": "アウェイなんだから、先輩の亜美がみんなのコト、\nとりゃー！って引っ張らなきゃなのにさ。", "zh": "毕竟这是客场，身为前辈的亜美，本来应该“嘿咻！”地带着大家往前冲才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1038_011ami", "source_sha256": "776c370cbf2ff050a9d0df8cbc0103b507a0cc9570c6b94100f1b07c19ffe8dc", "ja": "それなのに、ステージでも相手の空気に\n飲まれっぱなしとか……亜美としたことが～！", "zh": "明明都这样了，却还在舞台上一直被对手的气势压制……真不像亜美会做的事～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1039_p", "source_sha256": "b36a7a31dbad59032172910a0be4f30217579b967fe51d04ac3a64d17d3844f6", "ja": "そうか……亜美はみんなの事を、\n引っ張っていってくれようとしてたんだな。", "zh": "这样啊……原来亚美一直想带着大家一起前进啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1040_011ami", "source_sha256": "9494a8a7ac03be490ca19ecf31ae24606319bc2e31b79f8b1cce72440b24d244", "ja": "トーゼンっしょ？　だってこの中では、\n亜美が一番、アイドルの先輩だかんね！", "zh": "当然咯？因为在这里面，亚美可是最资深的偶像前辈嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1041_011ami", "source_sha256": "94ef799231e548cbebc4b346ff2764f4b0c7c8757246c07108a48366fe588e59", "ja": "だから次のイベントでは、絶対負けないし！\nあと、兄ちゃんは亜美たちだけのオモチャだし！", "zh": "所以，下次活动我绝对不会输的！还有，哥哥可是只属于我们的小玩具！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1042_p", "source_sha256": "6ba077070e3114cf82a808635eaf3a9e8e1c0548bc7f41f0a4caabb61ae5c96f", "ja": "いや、亜美達のオモチャでもないけど……。\nとにかく、わかったよ。ありがとう。", "zh": "不，我也不是亚美她们的玩具啊……  \n总之，我知道了。谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1043_p", "source_sha256": "8d7e9f24bc1e62c64da7490d5694bdb14f66c3d870ec017b2b198107ab73618c", "ja": "俺は亜美やみんなのプロデューサーだから、\n今度こそしっかりしないとな！", "zh": "因为我是亜美和大家的制作人，这次可得好好振作起来才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1044_011ami", "source_sha256": "3e9d54ce93c6f6b9353d085a09dacd91c3fbcb6ea421f19642514ea2863b603c", "ja": "うむ！　亜美たちから逃げようったって、\nそうはいかないってコトだよ、兄ちゃん君！", "zh": "嗯！就算想从亚美我们手里逃走，也没那么容易哦，哥哥君！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1045_011ami", "source_sha256": "966700e28bd39840024c46db0afcf2afee4902b666831c3a2f5f344baa520630", "ja": "兄ちゃんも、西エリアのアイドルも、\n全員まとめてギャフンと言わせてやる……！", "zh": "哥哥，还有西区的偶像们，统统都给我认输吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1046_011ami", "source_sha256": "7b75e3a91f7e4dd8de4f41a59d556f942d034d54c0bc2e3e62bd1e5c85610d49", "ja": "覚悟しときな！", "zh": "你给我等着！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1047_p", "source_sha256": "fb99e56d0b546aedc793751aee53d586d73c5da38e39b99018503b340d30ad9f", "ja": "ああ。楽しみだな！", "zh": "嗯。真令人期待啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0247_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_05_1048_p", "source_sha256": "a2c0905ac9f26c2628616814b729a172b0d7a21c08be69ffc6047931f653ebb7", "ja": "（西エリアでの出来事が、意外な形で亜美の心に\n火を着けた。これは……いい方向に行きそうだ！）", "zh": "（西区发生的事情，以意想不到的形式点燃了亚美的内心。这下……看来会朝好的方向发展！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
